{"term": {"label": "禮", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "1B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/liang-hui-wang-ii", "title": "梁惠王下", "description": "莊暴見孟子，曰：「暴見於王，王語暴以好樂，暴未有以對也。」曰：「好樂何如？」\n孟子曰：「王之好樂甚，則齊國其庶幾乎！」\n他日，見於王曰：「王嘗語莊子以好樂，有諸？」王變乎色，曰：「寡人非能好先王之樂也，直好世俗之樂耳。」\n曰：「王之好樂甚，則齊其庶幾乎！今之樂猶古之樂也。」曰：「可得聞與？」\n曰：「獨樂樂，與人樂樂，孰", "occurrences": 1, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "先", "id": "先"}, {"form": "出", "id": "出"}, {"form": "反", "id": "反"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "國人", "id": "國人"}, {"form": "大夫", "id": "大夫"}, {"form": "左右", "id": "左右"}, {"form": "有司", "id": "有司"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "禮", "variants": [], "id": "禮"}, {"form": "舍", "id": "舍"}, {"form": "見", "id": "見"}, {"form": "賢", "id": "賢"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.760009940032921, "source": "舍", "target": "出"}, {"weight": 0.16974277458709455, "source": "出", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 2.47232786758114, "source": "出", "target": "反"}, {"weight": 0.8140997909776078, "source": "出", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 2.760009940032921, "source": "出", "target": "有司"}, {"weight": 3.858622228701031, "source": "出", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 2.066862759472976, "source": "出", "target": "賢"}, {"weight": 2.5776883832389665, "source": "國人", "target": "賢"}, {"weight": 2.5776883832389665, "source": "大夫", "target": "賢"}, {"weight": 1.3249254147435985, "source": "有司", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 0.8628899551470398, "source": "見", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 1.3737155789130306, "source": "見", "target": "賢"}, {"weight": 1.2195648990857721, "source": "見", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 3.676300671907076, "source": "禮", "target": "賢"}, {"weight": 1.0860335064612496, "source": "先", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 1.7303905228517629, "source": "先", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 2.9831534913471307, "source": "先", "target": "賢"}, {"weight": 2.5776883832389665, "source": "賢", "target": "左右"}, {"weight": 0.6317782341836532, "source": "賢", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 0.680568398353